# W7b, guest b (k2): while a is cut it plays on near (442,-10), where it stood unhurt (its wander towards (-150,-60)
# crossed stag0101's rock slope: a k2 character died there during the grace in round r2a, tick 9751). Home by @290: in
# rounds r2b and r2c the END came at about @268 (the cut's 60 s grace from the proxy's own start), HOME 3 s later
# (World:EndNoticeTicks), the home departure 3 s, the lobby's entry 1 s: control at about @276, after the old bound @275.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
